{"id":"vneshnost_","lemma":"внешность","pos":"noun","rank":3133,"glosses":["appearance, look (physical appearance)","exterior, outside"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/06/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%88%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%88%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"внешности","plural":"внешности"},"examples":[{"text":"Я хочу изменить свою внешность.","en":"I want to change my appearance.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to change"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},null]},{"text":"Мне не нравится моя внешность.","en":"I don't like the way I look.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to like","l":"нравиться"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null]},{"text":"Не суди по внешности.","en":"Don't judge by appearances.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to judge","l":"судить"},{"g":"along / by"},null]},{"text":"Внешность может быть обманчива.","en":"Looks can be deceiving.","words":[null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,3,"maybe"]]},{"text":"Не дай её внешности тебя одурачить.","en":"Don't be fooled by her appearance.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"the more insistent form…"},{"g":"her"},null,{"g":"you","l":"ты"},{"g":"to fool"}]}]}